 "q-104119" :question/problem "Simplify the expression ${[\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{2\\theta }{5})+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{2\\theta }{5})]}^{20}.$" :question/worked-solution "De Moivre's Theorem states that\n\n$$\n[\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\phi )+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\phi )]^{n}=\\operatorname{cos}⁡(n\\phi )+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(n\\phi ).\n$$\n\nIn our expression, we have $n=20$ and $\\phi =\\frac{2\\theta }{5}.$ Substituting in these values, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{[\\operatorname{cos}⁡(\\frac{2\\theta }{5})+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(\\frac{2\\theta }{5})]}^{20} & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡(20\\cdot \\frac{2\\theta }{5})+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(20\\cdot \\frac{2\\theta }{5}) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cos}⁡(8\\theta )+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(8\\theta ).\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-104119/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "5055bd50-a6aa-547d-9ce3-573d79ac2e91"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-104119"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-17326/selection/62cb17b690a269eceee43a75e45669cd1bdb82bf304c8ae97a1367142141cc56" :answer/id #uuid "ef18ac32-37b6-546a-ad79-7ba2cef6afc3" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10(\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta -\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-17326/selection/e7b19e894015d51f7112edf8251d4bd60447577974fc4a413a8f2023741b2d50" :answer/id #uuid "22f21ce6-74a4-5bad-a06b-f8a1fc8ecbdc" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\operatorname{cos}⁡(10\\theta )+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(10\\theta )" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-17326/selection/896745e338fbf78de5abe6ca0eded03a3bdb5cf674bb32aa8b60a362b1747ce2" :answer/id #uuid "6c817756-f443-547b-b5b6-9d8afd73b1e6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10(\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta +\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta )" :db/ensure [:answ